    <div class="rules-section"><div class="rules-section-title">Vertical Combos (in one slot)</div><div class="rules-text"><ul><li>Element Chain 3/4/5: 3/4/5 pts</li><li>Number Chain 3/4/5: 4/5/6 pts</li><li>Run 3/4/5: 3/5/7 pts</li><li>Twin Ultimates: 8 pts</li></ul></div></div>
    <div class="rules-section"><div class="rules-section-title">Horizontal Combos (across slots)</div><div class="rules-text"><ul><li>Element Row 3/4/5: 4/7/10 pts</li><li>Number Row 3/4/5: 5/8/12 pts</li><li>Number Run 3/4/5: 6/9/13 pts</li><li>Elemental Set (all 4 elements): 8 pts</li><li>Perfect Harmony (4 same + Ultimate): 11 pts</li></ul></div></div>
